整理桌面的人，也未必觉得准备是负担。那可能正是他们享受的一部分。想省下哪些动作，并没有统一答案：有人嫌笔总找不着，有人只是不想每次都把餐桌清空。先认出自己卡住的那个小地方，比照着别人的装备清单添东西更有意思。"}],"id":"legacy-b10","type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"marks":[],"text":"不买新工具，也有可以试的小改动"}],"id":"legacy-b11","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"content":[{"marks":[],"text":"若只是找笔麻烦，可以试着把常用的那支和本子放在一起；若桌面紧张，也许现有的小本子就够了。这些只是可选的小尝试，不保证让人更勤快，更不需要把爱好变成一项按时完成的任务。"}],"id":"legacy-b12","type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"marks":[],"text":"看过这件画架后，我更愿意留下的是一个小问题：下一次想记点什么，能不能少找一样东西，少挪一下位置？有兴致时画两笔，没有兴致就把本子合上。纸上留下一个没画完的杯把，也不妨碍这只是普通的一天。"}],"id":"legacy-b13","type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"marks":[],"text":"参考：Colossal《Meet the Lap Easel, a Portable Companion for Taking Creativity Anywhere》。这是带有商店链接的产品介绍；文中生活场景为设想，不是产品亲测。"}],"id":"source-note","type":"paragraph"}],"citations":[{"block_id":"legacy-b5","end":109,"fact_pack_item_id":6,"id":"life-source-3","selected_text_hash":"aa724a994e29a4164ce9253ec5f4dba7b670936ff4d723f70e083bc58f4d1333","start":0},{"block_id":"source-note","end":116,"fact_pack_item_id":6,"id":"life-source-12","selected_text_hash":"5ad9993658e3197a5c4d7c1732c4974a99d4e3c7eeea82faf2961ffe33423c06","start":0}],"schema":"studio.text.document.v1"},"title":"画两笔之前，能不能少准备一点？"},"payload_hash":"bea30ec1201d23bb03174906aff9c1b8907390a0135fda9b57f1d6c2213e8a34","payload_schema":"text.master.v2"},"quality":{"accepted_hash":"4b221ec130affb476b131fb1dcd9f523db5a6ce43f1577fddaabd6ac5cb0ab82","attempt_id":101,"context_hash":null,"decision":"accepted","domain":"checks","entity_id":101,"feedback_event_id":232,"node_id":"quality","output_kind":"workflow_step_attempt","payload":{"blockers":[],"checks":[{"check_kind":"master_schema","id":228,"input_hash":"7ca0c9cc91d1a819c337db35246ca335c7e1f9719f7dab9f283ecc2d15a797ae","report":{"reasons":[]},"report_hash":"0e7d07e7ce6b60f937fb0e74e5a595a6e3b4cf1311a41a70d0acd1cae8f7d8ec","status":"pass"},{"check_kind":"evidence","id":229,"input_hash":"4d9543fce925199803901d1d635581cc8de3f8eba64e4f1974db4ee5e4fc067e","report":{"reasons":[]},"report_h